    "group": "Pantheon of Woe",
    "summary": "**NECRONS MONSTER** units in your army gain **Distortion Fields (Aura)**.\n\nAny enemy unit within 6\" of one of those units is unravelling, and attacks that target an unravelling unit improve their Armour Penetration by 1.\n\nAs each phase starts, each **NECRONS MONSTER** unit of yours may suffer 3 mortal wounds; one that does has a 9\" Distortion Fields range until that phase ends.\n\nAn army with 2 or more **TRANSCENDENT C’TAN** units must give each of them **Reletavistic Tether**.",
